  NpcName: Marcus
  tipoVoz: 0
  retrato: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df16805cf478ed043bd0a29d4971465c, type: 3}
  dayGreeting:
  - "Don\u2019t tell anyone, but... the other day I was walking around Naius\u2019
    totem, and..."
  - I felt a terrible stomachache... and had to empty my bowels. Luckily, there was
    no one around.
  nightText: Good night.
  partyText: "The god Naius isn\u2019t angry with me, right? He doesn\u2019t know
    what I did at his altar... right? I\u2019d better leave."
  NpcId: Marcus9093a271-c337-4f57-a329-2dcecb9ef29f
  ActualQuest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb3fd5f28f974334b9dc92a5c4c6d5cd, type: 2}
  ActualGoal: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f53c30d82a1fd8c46a15439fac68d9fe, type: 2}
  GiveSecondaryQuest: {fileID: 0}
  QuestDialogue:
  - So... do you have them...? Wow! Thank you very much!
  - I'll save you a pastry at the next party!
